Institute of Computational Perception, JKU Linz) through its TypeScript port
@jgorset/beat-this, and downloads at runtime the ONNX export of its published
"final0" weights. Both are MIT-licensed; their licenses are reproduced in
server/utils/beatThis/LICENCIAS-TERCEROS.txt.
